          "Conduct secondary cold line temperature audit across all preparation inserts.",
          "Perform mid-shift cash drop for currency amounts exceeding $500 threshold into drop safe.",
          "Inspect guest restrooms: restock tissue, sanitize touchpoints, and empty trash receptacles.",
          "Review 86-board (out-of-stock items) with culinary team and update POS digital menu ordering status.",
          "Verify staff break compliance in accordance with FLSA and applicable state wage and hour rules.",
          "Hand off shift logbook to incoming evening lead, noting VIP reservations and special requests."
