          "Run automated wash and sanitize cycles on commercial warewasher; record final rinse temp (>180°F).",
          "Sweep and mop kitchen and service lines with degreasing agent; squeegee floor drains clear.",
          "Close POS terminals, execute blind cash drawer reconciliation, and print server sales summaries.",
          "Deposit reconciled cash bags into drop safe; retain manager dual-verification receipt.",
